<div id="menu"></div>

<main class="page">
    <h1>Table view</h1>
    <p class="lead">ContactsTableView is a UITableView subclass that dequeues ContactTableViewCell. The controller is data source and delegate.</p>

    <section class="demo">
        <h2>dataSource and delegate</h2>
        <p>Rows come from <code>tableViewNumberOfRowsInSection</code> and <code>tableViewCellForRowAtIndexPath</code>. Tapping a row calls <code>tableViewDidSelectRowAtIndexPath</code>; the delete button calls <code>deleteRowAt</code> because the table is editable.</p>
        <div class="row">
            <button id="table-view-add" class="button">Add contact</button>
            <button id="table-view-clear" class="button button-secondary">Remove all</button>
            <span id="table-view-count" class="table-view-muted"></span>
        </div>
        <table id="table-view-contacts" class="contacts-table">
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>Contact</th>
                    <th>Role</th>
                    <th></th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody></tbody>
        </table>
        <p id="table-view-selected" class="output">Tap a row to select it.</p>
    </section>
</main>
